f\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qjwVaLIYgplH2OpGXDv3jvZ9oe4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1712193,\"name\":\"Shy'm\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jTdm43tU4vpHyW6zLnsu9dg3U5B.jpg\"},{\"id\":1274886,\"name\":\"Willy Rovelli\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l7vfYdUKSZHWIEbLrw9MeclmfXu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1511439,\"name\":\"Jarry\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2o6ksCkYlGuiWDpRvGLEziOYm1J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1546653,\"name\":\"Corneille\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y2bMM2omLcGMhTx0K7Fc1h5k4wK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1018984,\"name\":\"Sofia Essaïdi\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6OSQeJhTJ8nWG0VYtk876OIql0P.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":354912,\"title\":\"Coco\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7CHF8gTLGooTbP4GznIGwaqAGL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel's family history.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":335797,\"title\":\"Sing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwopfpHqPCYBSgBuZwkaXXqHp14.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z9ft5HYHzWcasR6SGcgeluxTznB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A koala named Buster recruits his best friend to help him drum up business for his theater by hosting a singing competition.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1584,\"title\":\"The School of Rock\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock 'n' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock 'n' roll can change lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23398,\"title\":\"Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3lf6YCItKcF3Wrrs7tp1PL0eyOT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school's music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":342473,\"title\":\"Ballerina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":830784,\"title\":\"Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dN6XnCEP3AO7N4XFOFyZ8V8kZF5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zE97tcQOx7Ax6g1xKdKeCjTgpNl.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the Primm family moves to New York City, their young son Josh struggles to adapt to his new school and new friends. All of that changes when he discovers Lyle — a singing crocodile who loves baths, caviar and great music — living in the attic of his new home. But when Lyle’s existence is threatened by evil neighbor Mr. Grumps, the Primms must band together to show the world that family can come from the most unexpected places.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843891,\"title\":\"The Pirates of Penzance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfteQBo7igcmfHNFJeaO16aqvpr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sasha Regan’s award-winning All-male Company are set to lift everyone’s spirits with a treat in their new West End pirate’s cove. The swashbuckling pirates and their winsome lasses sail into the Palace Theatre with their inventive new take on W. S. Gilbert & Arthur Sullivan’s classic operetta THE PIRATES OF PENZANCE. Featuring a dazzling cast singing songs including: “I am a Pirate King”; “Oh, happy day, with joyous glee” and “A rollicking band of pirates we”, they are sure to raise the roof off the Palace Theatre!\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":847265,\"title\":\"Dashboard Confessional: MTV Unplugged 2.0\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v2NKslALnlHQbhdLmNWmFqqoFuB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bwtRUpWIlrZ2p9p91MwZag6DCh3.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dashboard Confessional plays an intimate set at the MTV studios in New York 2002 during the peak of their fame.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"cBhmYKEEAnY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"5SVyyUkUHUA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3tMF6TdhSPI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}